# SFP1/SFP2 source2 uses the same official asynchronous FIFO and toggle-event CDC
# structure as source1/source3.  Exempt only the Gray-pointer first stages and
# the first stage of each one-bit synchronizer; all destination-domain stages
# remain normally timed.
